          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "subtitle": "",
            "text": "<p>By knowing and recognizing the signs that your child may be ready to start walking, you can tune into their cues and support them along the way. Here are four telltale signs:</p>",
            "center": true,
            "width_mx": 550,
            "font_size": 1,
